2026-10-09T01:07:01.8612682Z E         - article:
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8612868Z E           - heading "飲食與採買" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8613006Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8613823Z E           - paragraph: It offers a high quality of life, a lively cultural calendar, plenty of cafés and restaurants, and easy access to Brittany’s coastline and countryside.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8613973Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8614108Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8614557Z E           - paragraph: Bed linen, kitchen utensils, crockery, and cooking equipment must be provided by the students.
