2026-10-09T01:07:01.8615639Z E           - heading "交通與地點" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8615779Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8616438Z E           - paragraph: The Paris campus is located at 9 rue d’Athènes, 75009 Paris , in the heart of the capital, close to Saint-Lazare station.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8616650Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8616790Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8617923Z E           - paragraph: "The campus is also well connected to Rennes city centre via the STAR public transport network : Pontchaillou metro station is approximately a 10-minute walk away, with bus routes and cycle paths also easily accessible."
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8618067Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8618217Z E           - group: 再看 1 則資料
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8618353Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8618566Z E           - paragraph: 可比較住宿到上述站點的路線，評估通勤選擇。
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8618714Z E           - group: 推論依據
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8618846Z E           - group: 繼續查詢
