2026-10-09T01:07:01.8622838Z E           - heading "安全、醫療與保險" [level=3]
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8622974Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8623918Z E           - paragraph: Before signing a rental contract, make sure you understand the main administrative requirements for renting accommodation in France, including deposits, guarantors, insurance and supporting documents.
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8624058Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8624194Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8625059Z E           - paragraph: "Service charge package: €95/month (including water, electricity, home insurance, household waste tax, Wi-Fi, and access to the fitness room and coworking spaces)."
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8625193Z E           - group: 資料來源
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8625336Z E           - text: AI 推論
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8625574Z E           - paragraph: 可先查詢上述健康服務；接診、語言與保險適用性仍須確認。
