2026-10-09T01:07:01.8626285Z E           - text: 官方 · 原文
2026-10-09T01:07:01.8627074Z E           - paragraph: Rennes is one of France’s most student-friendly cities, with a lively cultural scene, a welcoming atmosphere and easy access to the Breton coast.
